// GoFlow broker protocol — v1.
//
// Any language with a gRPC client (Go, Node, Python, Java, …) can:
//   1. Publish a job
//   2. Open a Consume stream, receive pushed JobDelivery frames
//   3. Ack / Nack each one back up the same stream
//   4. Administer the DLQ
